+## Changed
+
+- Copied the five files of `openspec/changes/347-rust-approve-default-branch-steering/golden/` unchanged into `crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/`.
+- Added `crates/apps/cli/tests/approve_default_branch.rs`:
+  - "Default-branch approvals equal TypeScript's" builds the four goldens' scratch repositories from `tests/fixtures/steered-repo` as `print-default-branch-goldens.mjs.txt` does, runs `approve 1` through `run_cli` with the registry's `features()`, and compares stdout, commits, branches, the tree record and the change folder's `.run/` tree with the golden, leaving out the delivery cursor and `approved` event lines and accepting any `synced` duration.
+  - "Conflicts through the CLI" builds `src/beta.js` and `src/delta.js` conflict cases with done tasks 1, 2 and 3, then checks the reopened tasks and retired trigger for beta and the planning stop, kept trigger, no-retry events and done markers for delta.
+
+## Deviated
+
+- The conflict cases write the same valid pre-main done marker for every task instead of recomputing each task's scope hash. The scenario checks marker presence after the run, and a marker whose scope differs is recertified; this also avoids adding `osq-kernel-storage` as a dependency of the CLI test target, which is outside the task's scope.
+
+Touched: crates/apps/cli/tests/approve_default_branch.rs, crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/git-off-001.txt, crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/merge-001.txt, crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/merge-noedit-001.txt, crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/print-default-branch-goldens.mjs.txt, crates/apps/cli/tests/fixtures/default-branch-golden/requirement-001.txt
